WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.544 --> 00:00:04.667
When we last saw Edward, he had just arrived on Offal Street.

2
00:00:05.107 --> 00:00:05.807
"Help! Help!"

3
00:00:06.408 --> 00:00:09.809
Edward cried as Tom's father, John Canty, dragged him home.

4
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:14.192
A few people followed them.

5
00:00:30.212 --> 00:00:31.013
"Are you all right?"

6
00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:33.354
a man in black called out to Edward.

7
00:00:33.374 --> 00:00:36.756
"No, I am not all right!"

8
00:00:37.216 --> 00:00:38.437
Edward said indignantly.

9
00:00:38.457 --> 00:00:43.800
"I am Prince Edward, and this stranger has kidnapped me!"

10
00:00:43.820 --> 00:00:50.023
"Be quiet, you miserable boy!"

11
00:00:51.064 --> 00:00:52.645
John threatened Edward with a stick.

12
00:00:54.266 --> 00:00:57.848
Suddenly the man in black reached out to snatch Edward away from John.

13
00:00:59.228 --> 00:01:00.469
"Stop interfering!"

14
00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.591
John struck the man, who fell to the ground.

15
00:01:06.933 --> 00:01:09.834
Without looking back, John dragged Edward into a house.

16
00:01:13.416 --> 00:01:17.439
They climbed the stairs and John pushed Edward into a smelly, crowded room.

17
00:01:19.840 --> 00:01:25.984
Tom's mother was cooking over a fire in the fireplace, while his sister, Nancy, hung laundry nearby.

18
00:01:28.284 --> 00:01:31.265
"I found Tom wandering the streets," John said.

19
00:01:31.285 --> 00:01:35.107
"I told you before that I'm not Tom!"

20
00:01:36.207 --> 00:01:37.368
Edward stamped his foot.

21
00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:40.709
"I'm Prince Edward.

22
00:01:41.830 --> 00:01:47.032
Take me back to the palace gate, and my father, the king, will send Tom out to you."

23
00:01:47.052 --> 00:01:51.134
"Oh, my poor boy!"

24
00:01:52.514 --> 00:01:55.896
Tom's mother put her hands on Edward's shoulders and studied his face.

25
00:01:58.260 --> 00:02:01.543
"All your reading about royalty has made you think you're a prince.

26
00:02:02.764 --> 00:02:03.865
But that's not true.

27
00:02:05.147 --> 00:02:06.828
Can't you see that I'm your mother?"

28
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:11.212
Edward shrugged off her hands.

29
00:02:12.273 --> 00:02:14.195
"I've never seen you before in my life."

30
00:02:16.157 --> 00:02:17.778
Tom's mother began to cry.

31
00:02:17.798 --> 00:02:22.342
"Oh, Tom, what's wrong with you?"

32
00:02:29.227 --> 00:02:31.969
John laughed and ordered Nancy to curtsy to the prince.

33
00:02:31.989 --> 00:02:38.674
"Father, please stop teasing Tom and let him go to bed," Nancy said.

34
00:02:38.694 --> 00:02:41.155
"He'll be better in the morning."

35
00:02:41.175 --> 00:02:48.100
"Speaking of the morning John turned to Edward and held out his hand.

36
00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:50.702
"The rent's due tomorrow.

37
00:02:51.882 --> 00:02:54.204
Hand over what you earned begging today."

38
00:02:56.576 --> 00:02:58.957
"Begging? Princes don't beg!"

39
00:03:00.077 --> 00:03:03.138
Edward was insulted that John was bothering him about money.

40
00:03:05.279 --> 00:03:06.139
John growled.

41
00:03:06.159 --> 00:03:09.380
"Go to bed before I lose my temper and hit you!"

42
00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:14.101
Edward looked around the room but didn't see any beds.

43
00:03:14.121 --> 00:03:17.082
"Where am I supposed to sleep?"

44
00:03:17.102 --> 00:03:23.084
"Over there in that corner as usual," Nancy said quietly.

45
00:03:24.020 --> 00:03:26.642
She pointed to a pile of old blankets and straw.

46
00:03:29.284 --> 00:03:31.305
Edward was too tired to protest.

47
00:03:33.106 --> 00:03:35.288
He went over and lay down on the floor.

48
00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:43.573
Later, when everyone was asleep, Tom's mother tiptoed over to Edward.

49
00:03:43.593 --> 00:03:49.057
"I saved you some bread crusts," she said.

50
00:03:51.218 --> 00:03:53.380
Edward sat up and took a bite of stale bread.

51
00:03:56.073 --> 00:03:57.133
"Thank you, good woman.

52
00:03:58.274 --> 00:04:00.335
The king will reward your kindness."

53
00:04:03.056 --> 00:04:06.157
Tom's mother shook her head sadly and went back to her bed.

54
00:04:10.379 --> 00:04:12.660
not quite right," she thought.

55
00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:16.161
"Maybe this boy isn't Tom.

56
00:04:17.422 --> 00:04:18.822
Oh, but that's absurd."

57
00:04:20.923 --> 00:04:31.474
She tried to sleep but kept thinking, "If only there was some way to test him—" Suddenly Edward

58
00:04:31.514 --> 00:04:34.015
made a sound in his sleep as if he'd been startled.

59
00:04:34.035 --> 00:04:36.156
"That's it!"

60
00:04:36.576 --> 00:04:37.996
Tom's mother said softly.

61
00:04:38.016 --> 00:04:44.118
"Tom always makes an odd gesture whenever he's startled, even in his sleep.

62
00:04:45.299 --> 00:04:47.299
He covers his eyes with his palm out."

63
00:04:50.964 --> 00:04:54.906
She crept to Edward's side with a candle and struck the floor with her fist.

64
00:04:56.807 --> 00:04:59.629
His eyes flew open, but he didn't make the gesture.

65
00:05:02.651 --> 00:05:04.732
She tried twice more with the same result.

66
00:05:04.752 --> 00:05:07.533
"I don't understand.

67
00:05:08.614 --> 00:05:10.515
He's made that gesture his whole life."

68
00:05:13.117 --> 00:05:14.918
Tom's mother sadly crept away.

69
00:05:14.938 --> 00:05:20.721
"Something is wrong with my boy, but I won't give up on him."

70
00:05:24.463 --> 00:05:27.845
Around midnight everyone was awakened by a knock at the door.

71
00:05:31.487 --> 00:05:33.248
Tom's father stopped snoring.

72
00:05:33.268 --> 00:05:35.269
"Who's there?"

73
00:05:35.590 --> 00:05:36.170
he shouted.

74
00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.971
"What do you want?"

75
00:05:37.991 --> 00:05:42.534
"I came to warn you," said a voice outside the door.

76
00:05:42.554 --> 00:05:46.336
"That man you hit with your stick was Father Andrew.

77
00:05:47.596 --> 00:05:50.097
He's badly injured, and you're going to be arrested."

78
00:05:50.117 --> 00:05:52.679
"Get up!

79
00:05:52.919 --> 00:05:53.879
We have to leave right now!"

80
00:05:54.280 --> 00:05:55.760
John shouted to his family.

81
00:05:57.041 --> 00:06:00.463
Five minutes later the Cantys and Edward were flying down the stairs.

82
00:06:05.446 --> 00:06:07.207
They moved quickly through the dark streets.

83
00:06:09.908 --> 00:06:13.410
As they neared the bridge, they heard people cheering the prince and the mayor.

84
00:06:13.430 --> 00:06:16.872
"I'm supposed to be at the mayor's banquet!"

85
00:06:17.244 --> 00:06:18.525
Edward suddenly remembered.

86
00:06:20.747 --> 00:06:24.050
A line of bonfires stretched up and down both sides of the river.

87
00:06:26.292 --> 00:06:30.215
Periodically there was a great booming sound as fireworks filled the sky.

88
00:06:32.597 --> 00:06:34.639
People danced and sang in the streets.

89
00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.342
The Cantys and Edward joined the crowd.

90
00:06:38.362 --> 00:06:44.588
"If we get separated, we'll meet on the bridge," John shouted to his family.

91
00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:47.500
But Edward had other plans.

92
00:06:48.661 --> 00:06:52.122
From the moment they'd left the house, he had been hoping to escape.

93
00:06:54.002 --> 00:06:57.923
Suddenly a man bumped into John, who lost his grip on Edward.

94
00:06:59.384 --> 00:07:02.084
Edward seized the opportunity and ran off.

95
00:07:02.104 --> 00:07:09.326
"If I find Tom at City Hall, pretending to be me, he'll spend the rest of his life

96
00:07:09.366 --> 00:07:10.067
in prison.

97
00:07:11.487 --> 00:07:12.607
I'll make sure of that!"
